{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"agent_message","text":"The closeout-policy tests passed in all three packages. The publication test also passed under the race detector, and `go vet` passed. Surface-check reports one target, 213 results, and zero findings.\n\nI found a low-severity conservative parsing issue: `href=` or `src=` inside an HTML comment can make the association result unknown, even though CommonMark treats it as a comment. This can block an exemption, but cannot grant one. I’m checking the artifact output before finalizing."}}
